# tCrm — Cursor Rules

Internal CRM monorepo. Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/rules.md`, `docs/design.md`, and `docs/inventory_and_logistics_flows.md` before making changes. When a change affects user-visible flows, update that flows doc and the in-app user guide (`docs/user-guide/`, `/help`) in the same task (see `.cursor/rules/flows-documentation.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/user-documentation.mdc`).

## Stack

Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · TypeScript strict · Tailwind v4 · shadcn New York+zinc · MongoDB/Mongoose · Auth.js v5 · Turborepo/pnpm

## Key conventions

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed
- Server Actions + `useActionState` for forms (not RHF)
- Co-locate `actions.ts` next to routes
- Models in `@crm/db-core`, auth in `@crm/auth`, shared utils in `@crm/lib`
- Always use `requirePermission()` in admin routes and mutations
- User-visible email: `sendTemplatedEmail` from `@crm/mail` (see `docs/rules.md` §8); logistics via `enqueueLogisticsNotification` from `@crm/logistics`
- Wrap pages in `<Container>` from `@crm/ui`
- List views → `DataTable` (`tableId` required); panels → `EntitySheet` (not inline Cards above tables). Server pages use a client `*-table.tsx` wrapper — never pass `rowHref`, `rowDetail`, or column `render` from RSC (see `.cursor/rules/datatable.mdc`)
- Product CRM SKU in UI → always with localized name (`ProductSkuLabel` / `.cursor/rules/product-sku-display.mdc`)
- Use semantic Tailwind tokens, not raw colors

## Workspace packages

`@crm/auth` `@crm/db-core` `@crm/lib` `@crm/ui` `@crm/admin` `@crm/rbac` `@crm/mail` `@crm/media` `@crm/inventory` `@crm/logistics` — never import across `apps/*`

## Current scope

Phase 0 foundation + Phase 1 inventory + Phase 2 logistics/builds are live. Offers, HR/accounting, and titoktár are later.

## Before push

Run `pnpm preflight` (Husky pre-push runs this automatically). E2E is opt-in — see `.cursor/rules/pre-push.mdc`.
